0..75 Comment "// The integers\' sum and its laws, after cubical Agda\'s `Cubical/Data/Int`:"
76..153 Comment "// the sum by recursion on its second summand, zero a unit of it, a successor"
154..221 Comment "// or a predecessor brought out of its left, and the sum commuting."
222..290 Comment "// `circle-group.gandr` reads these laws through the winding number."
291..293 Comment "//"
294..323 Comment "// - see: #427 — `plusComm`"
325..386 Comment "// The integers, one successor more and one predecessor more."
