1811..1888 Comment "/// The sum commutes (cubical\'s `+Comm`), by induction on the second summand,"
1889..1963 Comment "/// each step the recursive call carried along `up` or `down` and then the"
1964..2041 Comment "/// summand brought out of the left. The arms compose to no conversion of the"
2042..2116 Comment "/// answer at `x`, yet `Int` is a set, so its rules are respected by their"
2117..2137 Comment "/// endpoints alone."
